# Leonardo, Sewer Samurai lets creature spells with power or toughness 1 or less be cast from the graveyard (CR 601.3). A
# permission is judged on the spell the card would be (CR 601.3e): Springheart Nantuko cast bestowed is an Aura enchantment
# spell and no creature (CR 702.103b), so Leonardo does not let it be bestowed, though it lets the 1/1 Nantuko be cast as a
# creature for its mana cost - and so Bot1 does, with the mana for the bestow cost too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Leonardo, Sewer Samurai
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Faithless Looting
Springheart Nantuko
Mountain
Forest
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

